need grows and new training programs are developed, CDC will provide training materials and guidance that will allow individuals to create their own training in the OneLabVR environment.", "short_description": "Situated on the 4th floor of a fictitious building, OneLabVR encompasses a 50,000 square foot facility that is focused on clinical and public health laboratory training. OneLabVR includes 12 different laboratories, and over 100 (and counting) laboratory-specific pieces of hardware and equipment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.cdc.gov/labtraining/training-courses/VR_Training_Privacy_Policy_Page.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Centers for Disease Control and Prevention", "support_website_url": "https://www.cdc.gov/labtraining/onelab/onelabvr.html", "website_url": "https://www.cdc.gov/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "794607812260786"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1429582311131197"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1429582311131197"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1686836880, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1429582311131197"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes"